compression.description:
Native-protocol compression. ZSTD is the measured throughput default;
LZ4 trades throughput for less compression work, while `none` is useful
only for an explicitly measured transport that is not network-bound.

max_pending_upload_objects.description:
Soft admission limit for pending uploads in one partition actor. An
atomic source message may temporarily take the actor above this value;
pending upload timing never changes deterministic object boundaries.
